## Sign-off: you own it

- [ ] **Every finding has been traced back to its DEPTH layer**  
  A lost insight sends us back to Trust, a colour problem back to Patterns. Fix it in the layer where it belongs, then test again.
- [ ] **Every "no" is either fixed or has an owner and a date**  
  Keep a simple log of issue, layer, owner and due date. It shows progress and makes the next review faster.
- [ ] **A person, not a tool, has confirmed the report is ready to publish**  
  Automated checks and AI reviews are evidence, not approval. AI builds it, we own it, so someone puts their name to the sign-off.

